[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13801.75, "timestamp": "03:50:01", "text": "Instagram 真实，都喜欢那种垂直方向的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13804.229, "timestamp": "03:50:04", "text": "内容。是的。但我很好奇这是怎么回事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13805.75, "timestamp": "03:50:05", "text": "当你……时，我希望翻译得好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13807.349, "timestamp": "03:50:07", "text": "就像玩一款游戏，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13809.11, "timestamp": "03:50:09", "text": "知道，水平的。会不会只是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13812.79, "timestamp": "03:50:12", "text": "屏幕真的很小？我完全没有头绪。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13815.51, "timestamp": "03:50:15", "text": "我也毫无头绪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13818.469, "timestamp": "03:50:18", "text": "看起来挺酷的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13821.99, "timestamp": "03:50:21", "text": "是的。嗯。事情的现状如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13823.54, "timestamp": "03:50:23", "text": "一切？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13825.189, "timestamp": "03:50:25", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13827.67, "timestamp": "03:50:27", "text": "是的。是否存在任何类型的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13829.429, "timestamp": "03:50:29", "text": "你期待的内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13832.15, "timestamp": "03:50:32", "text": "将来制作或者你知道的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13833.91, "timestamp": "03:50:33", "text": "你看起来像什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13835.429, "timestamp": "03:50:35", "text": "你期待参加的活动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13838.63, "timestamp": "03:50:38", "text": "未来？哦，活动。说到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13840.79, "timestamp": "03:50:40", "text": "活动，是的。呃，其中一件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13844.15, "timestamp": "03:50:44", "text": "我一直渴望这样做，我正计划这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13847.83, "timestamp": "03:50:47", "text": "如果我下个月去日本的话，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13850.87, "timestamp": "03:50:50", "text": "实际上是为了开展更多合作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13853.83, "timestamp": "03:50:53", "text": "然后进入日本 YouTube 领域"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13856.95, "times